Subject: [PATCH] schemas: remove duplicate metadata from the away key

The away key already has a summary and description. Remove the second
empty copies so GLib can compile the whole mediakey schema under --strict.
Keep its XF86Away default and descriptive text unchanged.

Applies to upstream 6.0.13, commit 00a92111f8f0cc7bcba8af9ae2a9950c7f02ae4e.

diff --git a/schemas/com.deepin.dde.keybinding.mediakey.gschema.xml b/schemas/com.deepin.dde.keybinding.mediakey.gschema.xml
index 719e5f2..46e3d58 100644
--- a/schemas/com.deepin.dde.keybinding.mediakey.gschema.xml
+++ b/schemas/com.deepin.dde.keybinding.mediakey.gschema.xml
@@ -316,8 +316,6 @@
             <default>['XF86Away']</default>
             <summary>Lock user</summary>
             <description></description>
-            <summary/>
-            <description/>
         </key>
 
         <key type="as" name="messenger">
